<title>UK: McKechnie H1 pretax rises 36 pct.</title>
<headline>McKechnie H1 pretax rises 36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to January 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		19.6		   vs 16.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.5		    vs 6.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     28.1		   vs 21.6</p>
<p> Turnover		   323.3		  vs 269.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British plastics and components group is McKechnie Plc. The company said it expected a one-off cost of not more than $6.5 million this year to terminate a major loss-making contract.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
